# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# The leaf menu offers the programs that are installed beside this shell,
# and choosing one STARTS it: the editor opens a window of its own over
# the session, which is the same route any application takes.
wait 12
click 980 20
wait 4
expect-menu Terminal|Text editor
note choosing the editor starts it; its window arrives over the session
menu-pick Text editor
wait 90
expect-title Edit
key Escape
wait 20
expect-no-title Edit
